<title>SINGAPORE: Bangchak buys Apr MTBE at $270-$275/T from SABIC.</title>
<headline>Bangchak buys Apr MTBE at $270-$275/T from SABIC.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai refiner Bangchak Petroleum Plc has bought 1,500 tonnes of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC) between $270-$275 per tonne, cost-and-freight (c-and-f) Thailand, industry sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender for April 16-30 delivery, closed March 19.</p>
<p>In its last MTBE tender, Bangchak bought its March requirement from SABIC at $280-$285 per tonne c-and-f Thailand.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
